<title>CHINA: China Jan-June coal output up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-June coal output up 1.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's produced 675.7719 million tonnes of coal in the first half of this year, up 1.9 percent from the same year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Thursday.</p>
<p>Coal output in June alone was 122.6487 million tonnes, the report said, but did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
